      en: ["Apricot blossom in spring is a major attraction", "Hunza is known for the longevity of its people", "Dried apricots are a winter staple", "Valuable oil is extracted from the kernels", "Cultivation occurs on hand-carved terraces", "The 'Halman' variety is particularly prized", "Part of the ancient 'Silk Road' trade route"],
